      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The simultaneous occurrence of left bundle branch block and right axis deviation is very rare and occurs mainly in patients with cardiomyopathy. This paper describes a 61-year-old man with end stage ischaemic heart disease who presented with this unique electrocardiographic abnormality."},
